+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-vet-003"></a>
+
+The clinic also publishes the inverse view: every specialty it knows, each shown with the veterinarians holding it (specified 2026-08-07). A specialty is shown under the name the clinic stores for it, and every specialty appears together on one page. A veterinarian is named in full — first name, then last name. The page lists specialties rather than the veterinarian roster, so a veterinarian holding no specialty appears nowhere on it. It is a listing, not a search, and it changes no record `[REQ-VET-003]`.
