+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a specialty that veterinarians hold, when the directory is opened, then each holder is named first name then last name.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given a veterinarian holding no specialty, when the directory is opened, then that veterinarian is named nowhere on it.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given every specialty the clinic knows, when the directory is opened, then all of them appear together, with no paging.
+- `[REQ-VET-003]` given the supported languages, when the directory is opened, then its wording is presented in the reader's language.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. A specialty that no veterinarian holds still appears, with no veterinarian named under it.
+2. The specialties, and the veterinarians under each, are presented in a stable order rather than an arbitrary one.
